{"id":"wb-6-1055","name":"石龙坝水电站","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"石龙坝水电站","text":"石龙坝水电站位于中国云南省昆明市西山区青鱼村以北的螳螂川（普渡河）上，于1912年建成，为中国第一座水电站。\n螳螂川是滇池唯一的出水口，从湖口至石龙坝河段，落差30余米。石龙坝水电站就是以滇池为天然调节水库，利用该段的天然落差兴建的引水式水电站。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9F%B3%E9%BE%99%E5%9D%9D%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%99","revisionId":93356664,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93356664","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2f41829f5fc815f50caaa213.jpg","title":"石龙坝水电站_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%9F%B3%E9%BE%99%E5%9D%9D%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%99_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9e/%E7%9F%B3%E9%BE%99%E5%9D%9D%E6%B0%B4%E7%94%B5%E7%AB%99_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangmoon618","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​石龙坝水电站","width":320,"height":186}}